{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_04",
  "title": "重逢不乏意外",
  "storyCode": "EP-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e8a925db357aad3b95be9f0162f4b240c95d7b62f99ca19ebab2b10a9b404f9d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g13_ibtown_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飢餓的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拘謹的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馱獸入欄的時候，我不小心激怒了牠，導致一名教士被抓傷，給我少裝一點吧，就當是贖罪……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多吃一點，下次才不會出這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這條鹽鱗夠所有人飽餐一頓，大家都多吃一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拘謹的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，西爾弗大人，吃太飽的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總比浪費還好。現在這個天氣，鹽鱗肉存不了太久，儘早吃完吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廚師先生，這幾份麻煩你送去給受傷的教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這陣子他們舊傷未癒，又加了幾處新傷，也該好好補一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執裁官閣下，請問您看過那份計劃書了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白，您為何會有這樣的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要那些強盜交出羅盤和鹽船的設計圖，我就會赦免大多數的人，允許他們以我指定的方式生活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們中有不少精壯的年輕人，如果我們的小鎮將來要移動，那就是最寶貴的勞力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，掌握著這些不受教條束縛的刀劍，我們以後和誰談判，都會輕鬆很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們會毀了您的小鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除掉領頭的那個阿戈爾人，剩下的強盜不過是一盤散沙。現在地下室銬著的那三個人，都各自打著算盤呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到我把他們分裂開來，分別放在互相之間會有利益衝突的位置上……哪怕他們還有歹心，也只會向曾經的同伴舉刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您曾經拯救了鎮上的所有人，教他們克制慾望、保持純潔……而如今您竟要為利益而赦免殺害過他們親朋好友的強盜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕您能接受，您真的認為鎮民們都能接受？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這難道不是背叛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您認為該怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很快會再帶人深入鹽漠，徹底剿滅殘存的強盜，毀去他們用於作惡的一切手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也看到受傷的教士們了，他們需要休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的人手和資源都不夠再進行一次大規模的圍剿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會確保他們能夠出戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，恕我直言，這不是您能做的決策，執裁官閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天色一暗下來，地下室的那三個強盜就會“偷溜”出鎮。不出意外的話，他們很快就能把消息帶回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您只需要在強盜上門談判的時候維持秩序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g6_olddeck_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……為什麼突然改變主意了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是修復一枚羅盤而已，沒有那麼多要考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……心裡沒事的人，手上是不會這麼不安分的。我該擔心你在我的船上面摳出一個洞來嗎，小傢伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並沒有用那麼大的力氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這樣，一本正經的傢伙才最讓人覺得滑稽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換套衣服吧，你身上都是血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，忘記叫你屏住呼吸了，這間艙房已經封閉了幾十年，灰塵很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，我不該在你的船艙裡隨意亂碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把我說得像個小氣又記仇的女人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想摸就摸吧，這些都是最上等的煉金器械，沒那麼脆弱。你肯定不覺得自己那隻小手比風暴和炮火更有破壞力吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，以後這就是你的工作室了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是一間正規的艦載煉金工坊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是以前船上煉金術師的衣服，試試看吧。你和他的身材差不多，應該很適合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，這個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左手邊有間儲藏室，去那裡換吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，很適合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，喜歡嗎？雖然是幾十年前的款式，但卻是專門訂製的，用的都是上好的布料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但衣服摸起來像是全新的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來想當作成年禮物送給那孩子的，可惜他運氣不好，成年前一天跟國防軍的炮彈一起掉進海裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我親自去撈，什麼也沒撈到。幸好那個時候的海嗣不多，但願他是被普通的鱗吃掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們打過國防軍的艦隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大靜謐之前，人人都還能出海時的事情了。這艘征服宣告號也是那個時候搶來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，小傢伙，你對歷史感興趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是聽過一些有關海洋的傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就該把羅盤修好，然後親自到海上去見證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前的要求只是我幫你修復羅盤，現在又增加了出海這一項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海上，羅盤也需要煉金術師來操作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過來，讓我看看，領子再稍微立起來一點，把披肩披好，真不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，剩下的我自己來就好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾天你儘量避免劇烈活動，雖然傷勢不致命，但船隊裡的衛生條件太差，一旦惡化，那後果不堪設想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了……怎麼感覺還差一點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還差一枚羅盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接過胡安娜遞過來的羅盤，伊西多用拇指輕輕摩挲著它的表面。\n很輕，很冰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能保證自己能成功，胡安娜女士，但我願意盡全力嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盡全力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然承諾了，我一定會做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
