    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真如首領所說，我們確實別無他法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們與鎮上的人世代仇怨，而他們把守著鹽漠通往內陸的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今，我們無路可退，只能面向大海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道就沒有別的出路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
