      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看，從外面帶回來的年輕壯漢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能挑能扛，吃得不多，只要請我兩個月鹹鱗汁，他就能給你隨便使喚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欣喜的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1589_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長得好像還不錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，這麼白，這麼瘦，感覺鹽鱗一尾巴就能把他掃飛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你這樣說，我就不樂意了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的肌肉很強壯的，只是穿著衣服看起來瘦而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看吧！只要一個半月的鹹鱗汁，這個小夥子就是你的了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？像我這樣的大帥哥應該值一年的鹹鱗汁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴！沒看到沒人要你嗎？還自己漲價了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年的鹹鱗汁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個月！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩週！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸！三天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我要了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境&拍賣的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三天份的鹹鱗汁，帳記在我的名字下面，成交？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛好缺一個保鏢，你以後就跟在我身邊好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我想想……就叫你小紅毛吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcave"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你竟然在鹽漠底下藏了這樣一個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，別聲張，會有人聽到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個玩笑不好笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為你分辨不出來呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……你帶我來是要我幫忙殺掉這隻海嗣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼要帶我來看牠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，你來到鹽漠是為了尋找一種由海盜創立的劍術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你要找的就是牠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "修羅盤修累了，你可以找牠學劍術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一隻海嗣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一隻吞噬了無數劍士的海嗣。如今，牠觸肢的每一次扭動都展現出那些劍士的技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許只是一種無意義的模仿行為，又或許牠認為這樣能幫助自己逃脫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……到底是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想解釋清楚有點難，當年想盡辦法將牠關在這裡後，我貼出懸賞令，希望找到能殺死牠的劍士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多人前來嘗試，但他們最終只是讓自己和自己的劍，都成了牠的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我更迷惑了。你為什麼要把牠關在這裡？為什麼要找人殺牠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又為什麼要我學習牠的劍術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本……船隊的船長不是我，是牠……他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的名字叫科魯茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年淹沒了這片土地的海水退去時，殘存的海嗣都開始發瘋似的攻擊城鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們拚死拚活，殺死了大部分海嗣……但這一隻格外難纏。科魯茲拿自己當誘餌，把牠引入洞窟，他們一起被困在了這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一次見面的時候，他將船長的職務交給我，囑咐我一定要帶著大家回到海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不告訴大家真相？船隊裡一直流傳著有關海嗣的恐怖傳言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些恐怖的傳言，就讓它們流傳吧……要領導船隊，我不僅需要他們敬愛我，還需要他們害怕我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那時就已經想好這些了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，是科魯茲告訴我的，他總覺得自己會死在我的前面，所以什麼都和我說，希望我在他死後能繼續他的事業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早該幫他解脫的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的想，但真的很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒辦法親手去殺……哪怕我知道那是一隻海嗣。我愛他，正如我深愛過去那些遠航的時日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答應我，拚了命去學，往你的小腦袋瓜裡能塞多少就塞多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，我還能……看到那些由他創立的劍術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g9_monasteryroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小葉？極境傳來的消息……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直接播放吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫蒂……我已經跟著逃跑的強盜回到了他們的老巢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你放心，沒人發現我的身分，我已經在這裡找到願意罩我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在這裡左右逢源，跟著她我很快就能找到棘刺的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用擔心，溫蒂，等我的好消息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g9_community_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，小紅毛，幫我把箱子搬來這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，老闆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯，力氣還蠻大的，今天你記得要努力叫賣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遵命，老闆！你就看我的吧，貨物清單我已經背得滾瓜爛熟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等我在這裡混熟了找到棘刺，我怎麼可能還聽你這個小丫頭的使喚？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人來了，快喊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上好的假眼球！鹽鱗骨雕刻，佩戴超級舒適，多種顏色可供選購！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有店主珍藏的陳年鹹鱗汁！口感濃醇，令人陶醉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士們，先生們，走過路過請不要錯過！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（齁……這傢伙還不錯嘛，嗓門真大，一點也不像一個當奴隸的……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士們，先生們，走過！路過！不要錯過——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……老闆，我的喉嚨都快喊到爛掉了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人人都看著我們這邊，但是為什麼沒有人過來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊……生意冷清得過分，而且，怎麼今天連找我理論的人都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，要來一顆嗎？萬一以後用得到呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神情古怪的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不買，帕斯卡拉小姐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！不買就不買，你那是什麼眼神，看起來感覺毛毛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神情古怪的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我勸你還是夾緊尾巴做事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，你不是說自己在這裡很吃得開嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然了……要不是我當老闆的為你疏通關係，你這個外來的傢伙早就引起別人的懷疑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這兩個人不是向來不把我放在眼裡的嗎？怎麼今天停下來看我好幾眼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小紅毛，你先收攤回去，我去打聽一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g9_community_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那幾個傢伙帶來的消息，真的準確嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經派人去核實了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的相信嗎？只要交出羅盤與偷羅盤的小偷，大家就可以被赦免，還能在鎮裡定居？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很難相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你還放任這城裡來的紅毛小子混進船隊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經不知道該相信什麼了，魯斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是喜怒無常的大海，還是不可捉摸的好意？無論如何，留著他我們終歸能多一個選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果事情真的發展到那一步，那個女孩好辦，綁起來交出去就行，但羅盤在首領手裡，你要怎麼交出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我會去找她談談的，事關船隊，她會聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "談談？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本還相信你能說服她，現在我只覺得你又會被她拖著走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你想讓我怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道呢，身為船隊的負責人之一，你總該負點責任吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（吃鱗屎的審判庭神棍，虧他們想得出這種主意，真歹毒啊……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g10_community_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆……你怎麼一回來就唉聲嘆氣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說……嗚……我聽說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別哭，老闆，你說，我幫你想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小紅毛，你對我真好，嗚嗚嗚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（廢話，我現在得靠你在這裡混下去。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小紅毛，我是為你苦惱啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，老闆，這和我有什麼關係啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我孤身一人在外漂泊，難過就難過吧，但現在有了你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，我任勞任怨幫你做了這麼多天工作，你不會現在就要開除我了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……我只是擔心，要是我出了什麼事，把你一個人孤零零地丟在這個海盜窩裡，怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（死丫頭又拿這個威脅我。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真是太感動了，放心，我小紅毛發誓，絕對不會讓老闆你出事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小紅毛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我晚上在船隊裡……聽到大家都在談論，說是要把我交給審判庭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為我拿了一個羅盤，這個東西之前還是我們家的呢，審判庭就窮追不捨，躲進鹽漠他們也不放過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別看我現在落魄，當年我家是有名的富商哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是家裡的財產都被變賣了，其中的羅盤不知為什麼就落入審判庭手裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真厲害啊，老闆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（呵，我一個字都不會信。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那您有什麼要我做的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，我聽說船隊裡的煉金術師在招助手，那個人是首領目前最器重的人，不如，我把你送過去試試？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你機靈又勤快，肯定能獲得他的賞識，到時候，你不要忘記幫我說兩句好話哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼好的差事，老闆你為什麼不去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我嘛……我和那個傢伙有一點點……一點點點……一點點點點的小過節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g8_oldcabin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下見到人家嘴巴記得甜一點！記得看眼色，知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，老闆，我一定在那位煉金術師有需要時第一時間衝上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，你也別太積極了，時機……時機也很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別讓他太舒服，稍等片刻，在他感到些許焦躁時再上去幫忙，他會更加離不開你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽你說的這句話，讓我覺得怪怪的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們兩個人的命運就都靠你了，小紅毛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等我在煉金術師那裡混熟了，誰還理你這個油嘴滑舌的丫頭。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哭泣的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哭泣的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的太過分了！怎麼可以這樣說我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是“硬漢比利”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "硬漢比利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，那個小子不是號稱自己去年從桅杆上掉下來都沒有喊過一聲痛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼從那間屋子裡出來就哭得稀裡嘩啦的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們也是來應聘煉金術師助手的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對……對啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽我的，快點回去吧，小夥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位煉金術師他……經常發脾氣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，比那個還恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心啦，小紅毛，別聽他們在這裡講壞話，那位煉金術師人很好的，之前還救過我的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人在工作時總會展露出另一副醜惡面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，說得也是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我進去不到三秒就被趕出來了，他嫌我的呼吸聲太吵，影響他的工作！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）老闆，我記得你和這位煉金術師有點小過節，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我不去了，你這樣不就是把我推進火坑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）哼，都走到大門口了，你還想溜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不進去！你這個丫頭一定又在打什麼壞主意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我進去！想跑，沒門！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從我的肩膀上下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊！不要抓我的眉毛，我看不到路了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要走去哪裡？都快撞到門了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g12_alchemyworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……好痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論你們出於什麼原因在工坊外打鬧，都打擾到我工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我把你們從窗戶丟出去，還是你們自己離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起啦，我只是想介紹一個助手給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你指的是那些分不清楚燒杯和燒瓶的傢伙嗎？還是自己帶回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個傢伙講的話也太狠了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊西多，這個傢伙是新來的，不懂規矩，你別……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小紅毛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，就是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我說你們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒人理會帕斯卡拉。伊西多攬過“小紅毛”的肩膀。\n“小紅毛”也將自己的手臂回架在他的肩膀上，搭在一起的兩隻手臂就像連接橋梁的堅固纜繩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們互相拍著對方的肩膀，力度之大，堪稱毆打。\n“小紅毛”的臉已經和他的紅毛一樣紅了，表情也因為痛苦扭成一團。\n而伊西多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這幾天是沒吃飯嗎？怎麼下手有氣無力的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然了，我為了找你瘦了幾公斤啊，你記得到時候請我好好吃一頓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎麼找到這裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有空再說我，先說說你吧？竟然沒有少條手臂少條腿，你這個小子運氣不錯嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你這個遺憾的語氣是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂……那個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帕斯卡拉沒能成功插嘴，對面兩人聊起來沒完沒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帕斯卡拉決定離開，臨走時她順手關好了門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
